{
  "id": "E305",
  "title": "The Meaning of “Luan”",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-03-01",
  "synopsis": "Correctly using the word “luan” can make your Chinese sound more native.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/982/b31eea3fdd1965e00a8f6ae5bced91ac318266d2.mp3?1550312893",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "“乱”的意思\n\n妻子：老公，我肚子不舒服。\n丈夫：怎么了？是不是你又乱吃乱喝了？\n妻子：乱说！我可能就是着凉了。\n丈夫：好吧，那你快去房间里休息一下吧。\n妻子：房间里怎么这么乱啊！你怎么总是乱放东西？\n丈夫：还不是因为你？总是乱买东西、乱花钱。家里都放不下了！",
    "traditional": "“亂”的意思\n\n妻子：老公，我肚子不舒服。\n丈夫：怎麼了？是不是你又亂吃亂喝了？\n妻子：亂說！我可能就是著涼了。\n丈夫：好吧，那你快去房間裡休息一下吧。\n妻子：房間裡怎麼這麼亂啊！你怎麼總是亂放東西？\n丈夫：還不是因為你？總是亂買東西、亂花錢。家裡都放不下了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Meaning of “Luan”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妻子：老公，我肚子不舒服。",
      "traditional": "妻子：老公，我肚子不舒服。",
      "pinyin": "qī zi lǎo gōng wǒ dù zi bù shū fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wife: Honey, my stomach doesn’t feel well."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丈夫：怎么了？是不是你又乱吃乱喝了？",
      "traditional": "丈夫：怎麼了？是不是你又亂吃亂喝了？",
      "pinyin": "zhàng fu zěn me le shì bú shì nǐ yòu luàn chī luàn hē le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Husband: What’s wrong? Did you go on an eating and drinking spree again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妻子：乱说！我可能就是着凉了。",
      "traditional": "妻子：亂說！我可能就是著涼了。",
      "pinyin": "qī zi luàn shuō wǒ kě néng jiù shì zháo liáng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wife: What nonsense! I might have caught a cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丈夫：好吧，那你快去房间里休息一下吧。",
      "traditional": "丈夫：好吧，那你快去房間裡休息一下吧。",
      "pinyin": "zhàng fu hǎo ba nà nǐ kuài qù fáng jiān lǐ xiū xi yí xià ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Husband: Fine. Then hurry up to your room and have a rest."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妻子：房间里怎么这么乱啊！你怎么总是乱放东西？",
      "traditional": "妻子：房間裡怎麼這麼亂啊！你怎麼總是亂放東西？",
      "pinyin": "qī zi fáng jiān lǐ zěn me zhè me luàn a nǐ zěn me zǒng shì luàn fàng dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wife: Why is the room so messy! Why do you always put things all over the place?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丈夫：还不是因为你？总是乱买东西、乱花钱。",
      "traditional": "丈夫：還不是因為你？總是亂買東西、亂花錢。",
      "pinyin": "zhàng fu hái bú shì yīn wèi nǐ zǒng shì luàn mǎi dōng xi luàn huā qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "家里都放不下了！",
      "traditional": "家裡都放不下了！",
      "pinyin": "jiā lǐ dōu fàng bú xià le",
      "english": "Husband: Isn’t that your fault? You always buy things without thinking and randomly spend money."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There’s not enough room at home to fit everything!"
    }
  ],
